      "49": {
        "id": "49",
        "type": "html",
        "name": "",
        "code": "<p>Please review the information below before submitting your repair request. By submitting this form, you acknowledge and agree to the following:<\/p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n    <li>\r\n        <strong>Ownership Authorization<\/strong><br>\r\n        You certify that you are the owner of the device or have authorization to request repair service on its behalf.\r\n    <\/li>\r\n\r\n    <br>\r\n\r\n    <li>\r\n        <strong>Diagnostic Authorization<\/strong><br>\r\n        You authorize <strong>Nocturnix Mobile Repair<\/strong> to inspect, diagnose, and evaluate the reported issue with your device.\r\n    <\/li>\r\n\r\n    <br>\r\n\r\n    <li>\r\n        <strong>Repair Estimate<\/strong><br>\r\n        Submitting this form is a request for repair only and does not guarantee service, parts availability, successful repair completion, or a final repair estimate.\r\n    <\/li>\r\n\r\n    <br>\r\n\r\n    <li>\r\n        <strong>Additional Repairs<\/strong><br>\r\n        If additional issues are discovered during diagnosis, no additional repairs or charges will be performed without your approval.\r\n    <\/li>\r\n\r\n    <br>\r\n\r\n    <li>\r\n        <strong>Communication Authorization<\/strong><br>\r\n        You authorize <strong>Nocturnix Mobile Repair<\/strong> to contact you by phone, text message, or email regarding your repair request, repair status, estimates, scheduling, warranty service, and completion of your repair.\r\n    <\/li>\r\n\r\n    <br>\r\n\r\n    <li>\r\n        <strong>Data Responsibility<\/strong><br>\r\n        You are responsible for creating a complete backup of any important data before submitting your device for repair. While every reasonable precaution is taken during service, <strong>Nocturnix Mobile Repair<\/strong> cannot guarantee the preservation of personal data during diagnostic or repair procedures. Customers acknowledge that data loss may occur due to device condition, hardware failure, or necessary repair procedures.\r\n    <\/li>\r\n<\/ol>\r\n\r\n<hr>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Please check the box below to acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to the Repair Authorization above.<\/strong><\/p>",
        "label_disable": "1",
        "css": ""
      },
