          "sender_address": "owner@nocturnixrepair.com",
          "replyto": "owner@nocturnixrepair.com",
          "message": "Hello,\r\n\r\nThank you for choosing **Nocturnix Mobile Repair**.\r\n\r\nWe have successfully received your repair request and appreciate the opportunity to assist you.\r\n\r\n### What Happens Next?\r\n\r\nOur team will carefully review the information and photos you submitted to better understand your device and the repair it may require.\r\n\r\nOnce your request has been reviewed, we will contact you using your preferred contact method to:\r\n\r\n\u2022 Answer any questions about your repair\r\n\u2022 Discuss the reported issue\r\n\u2022 Provide an estimate when applicable\r\n\u2022 Explain available repair options\r\n\u2022 Schedule an appointment if you choose to proceed\r\n\r\n**Typical Response Time**\r\n\r\nWe strive to review all repair requests as quickly as possible. Most requests receive a response within one business day during normal business hours.\r\n\r\nPlease note that submitting a repair request does not guarantee repair services, parts availability, or a final repair estimate.\r\n\r\nIf you need immediate assistance before we contact you, feel free to call or text us at **(802) 449-2171**.\r\n\r\nThank you for choosing Nocturnix Mobile Repair. We look forward to helping you get your device back in working order.\r\n\r\nSincerely,\r\n\r\n**Nocturnix Mobile Repair**\r\nMobile Repairs That Never Sleeps",
